{"ID":"20240221195058-7kfao1u","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240221195058-7kfao1u","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221195058-7kfao1u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221195126-gg2q8ju\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221195126-gg2q8ju\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221195126-gg2q8ju\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"瓦松","type":"doc","updated":"20240902105645"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240221195126-gg2q8ju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221195126-gg2q8ju","updated":"20240717114556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓦松 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓦松 1-20240717114554-blx9bp6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717114507-bd4w2vw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717114507-bd4w2vw","updated":"20240717115451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 823px;","style":"width: 813px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓦松"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓦松-20240717114507-nmx8olp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 813px;\" parent-style=\"width: 823px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 410px;","style":"width: 400px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓦松 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓦松 7-20240717115451-uv52lxy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 400px;\" parent-style=\"width: 410px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717114840-0c0yyux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717114840-0c0yyux","updated":"20240717114915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 712px;","style":"width: 702px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓦松 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓦松 3-20240717114840-f9oxcgy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 702px;\" parent-style=\"width: 712px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 537px;","style":"width: 527px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓦松 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓦松 4-20240717114915-9d03m7l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 527px;\" parent-style=\"width: 537px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717114735-taidx0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717114735-taidx0u","updated":"20240717115326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 600px;","style":"width: 590px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓦松 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓦松 2-20240717114735-cwz12ab.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 590px;\" parent-style=\"width: 600px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 652px;","style":"width: 642px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓦松 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓦松 5-20240717115100-gdkklqf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 642px;\" parent-style=\"width: 652px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717115100-zvknpus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717115100-zvknpus","updated":"20240717115757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 843px;","style":"width: 833px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓦松 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓦松 6-20240717115354-j5c59h6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 833px;\" parent-style=\"width: 843px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 427px;","style":"width: 417px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓦松 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓦松 8-20240717115757-1uegey9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 417px;\" parent-style=\"width: 427px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717114755-f7zn6ko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717114755-f7zn6ko","updated":"20240717114934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为一种长在瓦房上的多肉植物；"}]},{"ID":"20240717114756-spmckr1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240717114756-spmckr1"}},{"ID":"20240902105637-cl0wf8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-cl0wf8s","updated":"20240902105645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：瓦松"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-8osmyu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-8osmyu0","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓦松《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-43hpzla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-43hpzla","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】WǎSōnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-1ph8qs9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-1ph8qs9","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】瓦花、瓦塔、狗指甲"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-whks5kw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-whks5kw","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为景天科瓦松属植物瓦松Orostachysfimbriatus（Turcz.）Berg.和瓦花O.japonicus（Maxim.）Berg.的全草。夏、秋季采集，用开水烫后，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-ai9kfv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-ai9kfv1","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】酸，平。有大毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-zfsyui2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-zfsyui2","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】活血，止血，敛疮。用于便血，吐血；外用治疮口久不愈合。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-mcd19ei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-mcd19ei","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】0.5～1钱；外用适量，鲜品捣烂外敷或焙干研粉外敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-k340z7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-k340z7n","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-tkfrah3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-tkfrah3","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓦松《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-mw0t5l2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-mw0t5l2","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《唐本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-4y7d62i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-4y7d62i","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】WǎSōnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-elfwh8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-elfwh8v","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】昨叶荷草（《唐本草》），屋上无根草（《经验良方》），向天草（《庚辛玉册》），瓦花（《摘元方》），石莲花、厝莲（《福建民间草药》），干滴落（《东北药植志》），猫头草、瓦塔（《河北药材》），天蓬草（《中药材手册》），瓦霜、瓦葱（《四川中药志》），酸塔、塔松、兔子拐杖、干吊鳖、石塔花、狼爪子、酸溜溜（《辽宁经济植物志》），瓦宝塔、瓦莲花、岩松、屋松、岩笋、瓦玉（《浙江民间常用草药》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-ko543wj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-ko543wj","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为景天科植物瓦松或晚红瓦松等的全草。夏、秋采收，将全株连根拔起，除去根及杂质，反复晒几次至干，或鲜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-l7oxgol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-l7oxgol","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-gtejcv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-gtejcv5","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①瓦松，又名：流苏瓦松。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-n7tljpj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-n7tljpj","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生肉质草本，高10～40厘米。茎略斜伸，全体粉绿色。基部叶成紧密的莲座状，线形至倒披针形，长2～3厘米，绿色带紫，或具白粉，边缘有流苏状的软骨片和1针状尖刺。茎上叶线形至倒卵形，长尖。花梗分枝，侧生于茎上，密被线形或为长倒披针形苞叶，花成顶生肥大穗状的圆锥花序，幼嫩植株上则排列疏散，呈伞房状圆锥花序；花萼与花瓣通常均为5片，罕为4片；萼片卵圆形或长圆形，基部硝合生；花瓣淡红色，膜质，长卵状披针形或长椭圆形；雄蕊10，几与花瓣等长；雌蕊为离生的5心皮组成，花柱与雄蕊等长。蓇葖果。花期7～9月。果期8～10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-wzm811l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-wzm811l","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于屋顶、墙头及石上。全国各地均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-r8y4xfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-r8y4xfe","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②晚红瓦松"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-t818wjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-t818wjl","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生肉质草本，高10～20厘米。茎光滑无毛，全株被白粉及棕红色腺点，基部尤多。叶卵状披针形，或长圆状卵形，先端锐尖，微弯，有小尖头突出，全缘或具微细的波状齿。花序间叶状苞片卵状披针形或镰刀形；花密集成窄长圆锥状总状花序；花淡红色或白色；萼片5，披针形，长约为花瓣的一半；花瓣5，线状披针形或卵状披针形，基部相连；雄蕊10，5枚较长，伸出花冠外，另5枚较短，生于花冠内；心皮5，花柱与短雄蕊等长。花期8～9月。果期9～11月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-d6ms603","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-d6ms603","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于屋顶或岩石上。分布于辽宁，扛苏、浙江等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-r8l79gu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-r8l79gu","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】全国大部分地区均产。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-wugp6j2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-wugp6j2","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-54sjkkg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-54sjkkg","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干燥的全草，茎呈黄褐色或暗棕褐色，长12～20厘米，上有多数叶脱落后的疤痕，交互连接成棱形花纹。叶灰绿色或黄褐色，皱缩卷曲，多巳脱落，长12～15毫米，宽约3毫米，茎上部叶间带有小花，呈红褐色，小花柄长短不一。质轻脆，易碎。气微，味酸。以花穗带红色、老者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-17dldim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-17dldim","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，同属植物黄花瓦松的全草亦同供药用，分布西藏、新疆、内蒙古、吉林等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-s8l3cqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-s8l3cqu","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】含大量草酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-9dqnn6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-9dqnn6b","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-poxxv1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-poxxv1c","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸苦，凉，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-myz2k20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-myz2k20","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《唐本草》：\"味酸，性平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-6n7w8l0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-6n7w8l0","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草再新》：\"味苦，性寒，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-7r3dcun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-7r3dcun","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《四川中药志》：\"性凉，味淡，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-b0gzad8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-b0gzad8","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】《本草再新》：\"入肝、肺二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-repnp0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-repnp0c","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-g976v2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-g976v2y","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清热解毒，止血，利湿，消肿。治吐血，鼻衄，血痢，肝炎，疟疾，热淋，痔疮，湿疹，痈毒，疔疮，汤火灼伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-ed45roy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-ed45roy","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《唐本草》：\"主口中干痛，水谷血痢，止血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-tpgwgj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-tpgwgj1","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草图经》：\"行女子经络。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-qxrwarh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-qxrwarh","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《纲目》：\"大肠下血，烧灰，水服一钱，又涂诸疮不敛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-7snlxbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-7snlxbj","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草再新》：\"治百毒，疗火疮，消肿杀虫。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-r198vt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-r198vt2","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《分类草药性》：\"治一切痔疮肿痛出血，煎水熏洗。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-dqvsux8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-dqvsux8","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《科学的民间药草》：\"通便。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-g1zolpg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-g1zolpg","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《河北药材》：\"治水臌。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-cevfy6y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-cevfy6y","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《泉州本草》：\"清热，解毒，利小便。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-jo14fi1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-jo14fi1","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1～3钱；捣汁或入丸剂。外用：捣敷、煎水熏冼或烧存性研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-tydbjaj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-tydbjaj","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】《泉州本草》：\"脾胃虚寒者忌用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-j3h0q7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-j3h0q7n","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-7fl1bww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-7fl1bww","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-74dk5aw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-74dk5aw","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治吐血：瓦松，炖猪杀口内服。（《四川中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-m74w7yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-m74w7yh","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治鼻衄：鲜瓦松二斤。洗净，阴干，捣烂，用纱布绞取汁，加砂糖五钱拌匀，倾入瓷盘内，晒干成块。每次服五分至一钱，每日二次，温开水送服。忌辛辣刺激食物和热开水。（《全展选编·五官科》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-t4wrxfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-t4wrxfs","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治热毒酒积，肠风血痢：瓦松八两（捣汁，和酒一半），白芍药五钱，炮姜末五钱。煎减半，空心饮。（《唐本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-80tzz4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-80tzz4b","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治急性无黄疸型传染性肝炎：瓦松二两，麦芽一两，垂柳嫩枝三钱。水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-bf99t03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-bf99t03","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治疟疾：鲜瓦花五钱，烧酒一两，隔水炖汁，于早晨空腹时服。连服一至三剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-0gwni3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-0gwni3e","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治小儿惊风：瓦松五至六钱，水煎服。（④方以下出《浙江民间常用草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-l733r1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-l733r1d","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治小便沙淋：瓦松煎浓汤，乘热熏洗少腹。（《经验良方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-jslb70t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-jslb70t","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治火淋，白浊：瓦松熬水兑白糖服。（《四川中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-5frve9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-5frve9a","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治痔疮：㈠瓦松炖猪大肠头服。（《四川中药志》）㈡鲜瓦松，煎水熏洗患处。（《浙江民间常用草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-98rklrr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-98rklrr","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治湿疹：瓦松（晒干），烧灰研末，合茶油调抹，止痛止痒。（《泉州本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-tiry6fs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-tiry6fs","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治灸疮，恶疮久不敛：瓦松（阴干），为末，先以槐枝、葱白汤洗，后掺之。（《济生秘览》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-ee1wr36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-ee1wr36","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治疮疡疔疖：瓦松适量，加食盐少许，共捣烂，遍敷患部，日换两次。（《福建民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-7emmgnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-7emmgnr","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治唇裂生疮：瓦花、生姜。入盐少许捣涂。（《摘元方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-xdig40b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-xdig40b","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治汤火灼伤：瓦松、生柏叶。同捣敷。干者为末。（《医方摘要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-h3a1sow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-h3a1sow","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治肺炎：鲜瓦松，每次四至八两，用冷开水洗净，擂烂绞汁，稍加热内服，日服两次。（《福建民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-5bm24z6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-5bm24z6","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃治牙龈肿痛：瓦花、白矾等分。水煎漱之。（《摘元方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-ui6ou7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-ui6ou7t","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒄治疯狗咬伤：瓦松、雄黄。研贴。（《生生编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-de2es11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-de2es11","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒅治蜈蚣咬伤：鲜瓦松二两，酸饭粒少许，合捣烂烘热，贴患处。（《泉州本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-q8htrzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-q8htrzt","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒆治白屑：瓦松（曝干），烧作灰，淋取汁，热暖，洗头。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-68gl9md","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-68gl9md","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒇小便沙淋。用瓦楹煎浓汤，乘热熏洗小腹，约两时后可以下沙通便。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-8l8nvw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-8l8nvw0","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（21）通经破血。用鲜瓦楹五两熬膏，当归须、干漆各一两，烧烟尽，当门子二钱，共研为末，加枣肉和成丸仓，如梧子大。每服七十丸，红花汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-4nopmrk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-4nopmrk","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（22）头风白屑。用瓦松晒干，浇灰淋汁热洗。六、七次后即见效。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-gpqb45p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-gpqb45p","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（23）汤火伤。用瓦松、柏叶同捣烂，敷涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-od9o7f7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-od9o7f7","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（24）恶疮。用瓦松阴干，研为末。先以槐枝、葱白汤洗净患处，然后以药末涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-v50ng3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-v50ng3p","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-co0i22c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-co0i22c","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓦松《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-hdhsgxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-hdhsgxl","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《唐本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-dmppygb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-dmppygb","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】WǎSōnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-s8uqau4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-s8uqau4","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】FimbriateOrostachys,HerbofFimbriateOrostachys"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-krpmimi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-krpmimi","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】昨叶荷草、屋上无根草、向天草、瓦花、石莲花、厝莲、干滴落、猫头草、瓦塔、天蓬草、瓦霜、瓦葱、瓦宝塔、瓦莲花、岩松、屋松、松笋、松玉、狗指甲、岩脂、岩笋、瓦莲。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-oz37ags","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-oz37ags","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-imlnj48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-imlnj48","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为景天科植物瓦松、晚红瓦松、钝叶瓦松及黄花瓦松的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-lq7wsxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-lq7wsxn","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Orostachylfimbriatus（Turcz.）Berger[CotyledonfimbriataTurcz.；Sedumfimbriatum（Turcz.）Franch.var.genuinumFrod.]2.Orstachyserubescens（Maxim.）Ohwi[UmbilicuserubescensMaxim.；Sedumerubescens（Maxim.）Ohwi]3.Orostachysmalacophyllus（Pall.）Fisch.[CotyledonmalacophyllaPall.；Sedummalacophyllum（Pall.）Stend.]4.Orostachylspinosus（L.）C.A.Mey.[CotyledonspinosaL.；sedumspinosum（L.）Thunb.]"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-4d61ddx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-4d61ddx","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏、秋采收，用开水泡后晒干或鲜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-j0nkpu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-j0nkpu1","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-exiqwtd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-exiqwtd","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.瓦松二年生或多年生草本，高10-40cm。全株粉绿色，无毛，密生紫红色斑点。根多分枝，须根状。茎直立，不分枝。基生叶莲座状，肉质，匙状线形至倒披针形，长2-4cm，宽4-5mm，绿色带紫或具白粉，边缘流苏状，先端具半圆形软骨质附属物，中央有1针状尖刺；茎生叶互生，无柄，线形至披针形，长2-3cm，宽2-5mm，先端长渐尖，全缘。总状花序，紧密，下部有分枝组成尖塔形；花小，两性，苞片线状渐尖，叶片状；萼片5，长圆形，长l-3mm；花瓣5，淡红色，披针状椭圆形，长5-6mm，基部稍连合；雄蕊10，2轮，与花瓣等长或稍短，花药紫色；心皮5，分离，每心皮基部附生1枚鳞片，近四方形。蓇葖果，长圆形，长约5mm，喙细，长约1mm。种子多数，细小，卵形。花期8-9月，果期9-11月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-44tsk49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-44tsk49","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2．晚红瓦松二年生草本。第1年生仅有莲座叶，肉质，狭匙形或披针形，长1.5-3cm，宽4-7mm，先端长渐尖，微弯曲，有软骨质刺，全缘或具微细的波状齿；第2年从莲座叶中抽出花茎，高10-40cm，直立，全株被白粉，密生棕红色腺点；花茎上的叶线形至线状披针形，长2-6cm，宽3-7mm，先端长渐尖，干后有红色斑点。总状花序圆锥形，花密集，花序间有叶状苞片，卵状披针形或镰刀形；萼片5，长约4mm；花瓣5，白色或淡红色，线状披针形，长4-6mm，宽1.8mm；雄蕊10，2轮，较花瓣稍短，花药暗紫色；鳞片5,近四方形，先瑞有微缺；心皮5，直立，分离，基部急狭，花柱细，长2mm。蓇葖果，长约5mm。种子长约1mm。褐色。花期8-9月，果期9-11月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-y75d67k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-y75d67k","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3．钝叶瓦松二年生草本。第1年植株形成莲座丛，密生莲座叶，长圆状披针形、侧卵形或椭圆形，长2-4cm，宽1.5-2cm，先端钝或短渐尖，不具刺，全缘，密被暗红色斑点；第2年莲座丛中抽出花茎，不分枝，高10-30cm，花茎上的叶互生，较莲座叶为大，长达7cm。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-fmnrlq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-fmnrlq8","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"花序总状，有时穗状，花密集；苞片匙状卵形；萼片5，长圆形，长3-4mm，急尖；花瓣5，白色或带绿色，卵状长圆形，长4-6mm；雄蕊10，2轮，较花瓣长；鳞片5，钱状长方形，长约0.3mm，先端微缺；心皮5，卵形，分离，花柱长约1mm。蓇葖果。种子多数，细小，卵状长圆形，有纵条纹。花期7月，果期8-9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-getdwxx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-getdwxx","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4．黄花瓦松二年生草本。第1年植株形成莲座丛，密生莲座叶，叶片长圆形，先端有一半圆形白色软骨质附属物，中央有1个2-4mm长的刺；第2年自莲座丛中抽出花茎，高10-30cm；花茎上的叶互生，无柄，宽线形至倒披针形，长1-3cm，宽2-5mm，先端渐尖，有软骨质的刺。花序穗状或呈总状，顶生，长5-20cm；花梗长约1mm或无梗；苞片披针形至长圆形，长达4mm，先端渐尖，有刺尖；萼片5，卵状长圆形，长2-3mm，先端有刺尖，有红色斑点；花瓣5，黄绿色，卵状披针形，长5-7mm，宽1.5mm；雄蕊10，较花瓣稍长；鳞片5，近正方形，长约0.7mm，先端微缺；心皮5，披针形。蓇葖果，椭圆状披针形，长5-6mm，缘长1.5mm。种子长圆状卵形。花期7-8月，果期9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-liwma0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-liwma0t","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-zrh6vt6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-zrh6vt6","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：1.生于山坡石上或屋瓦上。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-6dx0pyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-6dx0pyl","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生于低山石上或溪沟旁。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-juelu8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-juelu8i","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.生于海拔1200-1800m的岩石缝中。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-oes6yqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-oes6yqm","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.生于干燥山坡石缝中或江岸石崖及砂质草原上。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-w6ett21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-w6ett21","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于东北、华北、西北、华东地区及湖北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-z27xzqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-z27xzqz","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于江苏、安徽、浙江等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-44bk7lc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-44bk7lc","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.分布于东北及内蒙古、河北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-tzroah0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-tzroah0","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.分布于东北及内蒙古、甘肃、新疆、西藏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-4oxw0z2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-4oxw0z2","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】性状鉴别茎黄褐或暗棕褐色，长12-20cm，残留多数叶脱落后的疤痕，交互连接成棱形花纹。叶发绿或黄褐色，皱缩卷曲，长12-15mm，宽约3mm。茎上部叶间带有小花，呈红褐色,小花柄长短不一。质轻脆，易碎。气微，味酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-0vi3lvs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-0vi3lvs","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】瓦松全草含槲皮素（quercetin），槲皮素-3-葡萄糖甙（quercetin-3-glucoside），山奈酚（kaempferol），山奈酚-7-鼠李糖甙（kaempferol-7-rhamnoside），山奈酚-3-葡萄糖甙-7-鼠李糖甙（kaempferol-3-β-D-glucopyranoside-7-a-L-rhamnopyra-noside）及草酸（oxalicacid）。晚红瓦松含草酸（oxalicacid）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-xdxdoig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-xdxdoig","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-uxvps53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-uxvps53","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻醉狗及兔给以静脉注射黄花瓦松流浸膏，血压先升后降，但很快恢复。对呼吸有轻度兴奋，对离体蟾蜍心脏可使收缩加强，心率减少。离体蟾蜍下肢血管灌流则可使之收缩，对离体兔肠有明显兴奋作用。对人工发热之家兔皮下注射流浸膏有明显解热作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-2phgdfq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-2phgdfq","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.强心作用：全草煎剂100%浓度0.7ml/kg静脉注射，使麻醉兔心脏收缩增强，50%煎剂静滴0.5ml/kg使豚鼠心率变慢，ST段下移，T波平坦或倒置，鸽法测得生物效价为每克干植物含0.23个洋地黄单位。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-h6g5ta3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-h6g5ta3","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.抗炎、镇痛：瓦松结晶Ⅰ号(3B-C1)300mg/kg腹腔注射，对二甲笨经起的小鼠耳炎、角叉菜胶引起的大鼠足跖肿胀有抑制作用；200mg/kg腹腔注射对巴豆油引起的大鼠肉芽肿有抑制作用；300mg/kg腹腔注射，对醋酸引起的小鼠扭体反应有抑制作用。抗肿瘤性疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-o6dilut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-o6dilut","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【毒性】小鼠腹腔注射流浸膏50-100g生药/kg可以致死，豚鼠腹腔注射50g生药/kg亦引起死亡。家兔静脉注射20g生药/kg,可引起跌倒、呼吸加快、战栗，但半小时后即能立起而逐渐恢复。每日用流浸膏滴兔眼1个月，对眼无损害，未引起结膜炎，亦不影响瞳孔大小。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-holznve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-holznve","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】酸；苦；凉；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-a069g1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-a069g1i","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肝；肺经"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-i68c1kc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-i68c1kc","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】凉血止血；清热解毒；收湿剑疮。主吐血；鼻衄；便血；血痢；热淋；月经不调；疔疮痈肿；痔疮；湿疹；烫伤；肺炎；肝炎；宫颈糜烂；乳糜尿"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-xwwszfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-xwwszfz","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，5-15g；捣汁；或入丸剂。外用：适量，捣敷；或煎水熏洗；或研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-c2qzyag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-c2qzyag","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】《泉州本草》：脾胃虚寒者忌用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-98miyn4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-98miyn4","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-zb8v7is","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-zb8v7is","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《唐本草》：主口中干痛，水谷血痢，止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-21wd8y0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-21wd8y0","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草图经》：行女子经络。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-bxas9aa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-bxas9aa","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《纲目》：大肠下血，烧灰，水服一钱，又涂诸疮不敛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-1410tvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-1410tvz","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草再新》：治百毒，疗火疮，消肿杀虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-ow7miwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-ow7miwu","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《分类草药性》：治一切痔疮肿痛出血，煎水熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-o172raz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-o172raz","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《科学的民间药草》：通便。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-nebekfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-nebekfn","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《河北药材》：治水臌。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-tru0htl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-tru0htl","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《泉州本草》：清热，解毒，利小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-w90eqhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-w90eqhp","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《唐本草》治胃热，酒积，烟火、金石丹毒成血痢肠风者，服之即止，此凉血而止血也。又女子内热血干，经络不行，服之即通，此又凉血而行血也。然气寒性利，通行之用居多，如血热气实，酒食味厚之人，间有用之取效。如老弱胃虚乏力之人，不可泛施。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105637-uupg6yt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105637-uupg6yt","updated":"20240902105703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105639-kgj1rpa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902105639-kgj1rpa","updated":"20240902105703"}},{"ID":"20240902105640-66amgr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105640-66amgr7","updated":"20240902105703"}}]}